{"parentUuid":"d8707449-4d44-478a-9122-564bdcb91592","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfNmLvBAwu5uTqvucCoiQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2664,"cache_read_input_tokens":192188,"output_tokens":1934,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":840},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2664,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1934,"cache_read_input_tokens":192188,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2664,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2664},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfNmLmgCfZhc6WgGiDzma","type":"assistant","uuid":"2980791d-8c02-4913-8894-5ef84885f53a","timestamp":"2026-09-24T18:49:38.295Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io","sessionId":"f31fbc8b-fac8-4283-8f36-bb5424b19347","version":"2.1.281","gitBranch":"main","slug":"enchanted-prancing-stroustrup"}
{"parentUuid":"2980791d-8c02-4913-8894-5ef84885f53a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfNmLvBAwu5uTqvucCoiQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The lamp posts are gone. Real race gates replace them, and there are new free 3D models: young trees, fallen logs, dry branches and granite stones. All six test suites pass, and a full play-through in the browser had no errors. Nothing is committed yet.\n\n**Removed**\n- The orange posts every 18 m down both edges of the piste, with their pulsing globes and the glow they painted on the snow.\n- Two shrubs that don't exist in an Alpine winter: a heath in pink bloom and a bilberry bush with fruit.\n\n**Gates**\n- Each gate is now two giant-slalom panels, red or blue cloth between two thin poles, alternating colour down the hill. They stand on either side of the racing line on the groomed strip, and the cloth moves in the wind.\n- A gate now only counts if you pass within 4.6 m either side of the line, not anywhere across the piste. Linking gates now takes skill.\n- Every gate you pass becomes the restart point, even one you missed. Pressing R never sends you far back up the hill.\n\n**New models** (all free to use, from Poly Haven; sources are listed in [MODELS.md](fun/alpen/assets/models/MODELS.md))\n- **Young firs and pines**, three of each, at the forest edges. Firs grow where the forest shelters them. Pines take the exposed ground, and near the top they grow low and flattened by the wind.\n  - The originals model every needle, at 125–160k triangles each. I rendered them into a texture instead, so each young tree costs 24 triangles.\n- **Two kinds of fallen log**, lying across the slope on gentle ground. They're solid and low enough to jump.\n- **Dry branches** scattered under the trees. They're decoration only, with no collision.\n- **Granite stones**: 2 in 5 of the decorative rocks are now one of three granite models.\n- None of Poly Haven's shrub models fit: they're all green, leafy summer plants. The young trees fill that role, and the existing willow scrub, dwarf pine and stumps stay.\n\n**Cost**\n- **GPU:** in daylight it's slightly lower than before: 8.7–8.9 ms per frame against 9.1–9.6 ms. At night it's about the same. Removing the snow glow paid for the new models.\n- **CPU:** unchanged at about 2.2 ms per frame.\n- **Draw calls:** up from about 76–150 to about 100–170.\n- **Download:** about 1.3 MB larger.\n\n**Worth knowing**\n- There are few logs near the top of the run on purpose, because that's above the treeline. After about 1 km there are around 24 logs and 100 branches in view.\n- Without the lamps, gates are harder to spot at night and in a blizzard. That's realistic, but it is a change.\n- I raised one test limit: the flow test now allows 55 s instead of 50 s to fill the flow bar. The narrower gates pay out less often, and the measured times were 43–50 s.\n- The scripts I used to render the trees into the texture aren't in the repo. [MODELS.md](fun/alpen/assets/models/MODELS.md) records the settings.\n\nThe game is still running at http://127.0.0.1:8000/fun/alpen/ if you want to try it. Should I commit and push to main? origin/main hasn't changed since the last push."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2664,"cache_read_input_tokens":192188,"output_tokens":1934,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":840},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2664,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1934,"cache_read_input_tokens":192188,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2664,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2664},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfNmLmgCfZhc6WgGiDzma","type":"assistant","uuid":"13774915-e387-4085-bbe1-c0556e065f65","timestamp":"2026-09-24T18:49:41.240Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io","sessionId":"f31fbc8b-fac8-4283-8f36-bb5424b19347","version":"2.1.281","gitBranch":"main","slug":"enchanted-prancing-stroustrup"}
