{"parentUuid":"c807b267-5c10-4f50-b615-30d81b73ed51","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfNrAPfRRmURhTkaAsHxg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're probably looking at an old copy of the game. The light posts are already gone from the code. I rode the current version by day, at dusk and at night, and the only things standing on or beside the piste now are the red and blue race gates.\n\nThere are two places where you could still see the posts:\n- **The live site** still has them, because this work hasn't been committed or pushed yet.\n- **The local game on port 8000** was probably reusing old cached files. The files that draw the posts hadn't changed since Sep 5, so Chrome likely kept its old copies on a normal reload.\n\nI stopped the port 8000 server and started a new one with browser caching turned off. It shows the current version: **http://127.0.0.1:8001/fun/alpen/**\n\nShould I commit and push to main so the posts disappear from the live site too? Nothing new has landed on main since the last push, so it would go straight in.\n\nIf you meant something else, like the gondola towers beside the run or the red trail-marker signs, tell me and I'll remove those instead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":742,"cache_read_input_tokens":242101,"output_tokens":1638,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1318},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":742,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1638,"cache_read_input_tokens":242101,"cache_creation_input_tokens":742,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":742},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinkin