 the flight used to pay under half the drag the snow charged","+       for the same body at the same speed, so leaving the ground was itself","+       a way to go faster: a jump down an even pitch landed quicker than the","+       line it skipped. The only thing the snow adds is friction, and the","+       only thing the air takes away is that. */","+    const airDrag = 1 / (1 + RIDER.drag","+      * (this.tucking ? RIDER.airTuckDrag : RIDER.airDrag) * vel.length() * dt);","     vel.x *= airDrag;","     vel.z *= airDrag;"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"32647735-0dd8-420e-a38a-f2344a059120","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/fun/alpen","sessionId":"f31fbc8b-fac8-4283-8f36-bb5424b19347","version":"2.1.281","gitBranch":"main","slug":"enchanted-prancing-stroustrup"}
