{"parentUuid":"2e2771ca-b0f4-419d-92cc-5cc92760f30a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c41cd6de-57c3-441a-96f7-ed621873bfe7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KvjHmwfUhuFW7WGhyGeGXC","type":"tool_result","content":"/* An award paid into the meter. Most awards also re-arm the hold; a gate\n   does not, because every gate on this mountain spans the whole piste and\n   staying on the piste is riding, not a trick. */\nexport function feedFlow(game, amount, hold = true) {\n  game.flow = Math.min(1, game.flow + amount);\n  if (hold) game.flowHold = SCORE.flowHold;\n}\n     full meter to one caught edge is the kind of punishment that stops\n     people trying tricks at all, which is the opposite of the point. */\n  flowPerPoint: 0.0042,\n  /* A gate is worth little meter because it costs little: every gate spans\n     the whole piste, so the ladder is really a count of how long the run\n     has stayed on it. At 0.035 a clean descent with no tricks at all was\n     filling the bar by itself. */\n  flowGate: 0.012,\n  flowButter: 0.05,\n  /* What riding alone is worth, and how the rest of the bar is held.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"296c8d5a-5282-417c-97e7-356219fe20b2","timestamp":"2026-09-24T20:21:44.565Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/* An award paid into the meter. Most awards also re-arm the hold; a gate\n   does not, because every gate on this mountain spans the whole piste and\n   staying on the piste is riding, not a trick. */\nexport function feedFlow(game, amount, hold = true) {\n  game.flow = Math.min(1, game.flow + amount);\n  if (hold) game.flowHold = SCORE.flowHold;\n}\n     full meter to one caught edge is the kind of punishment that stops\n     people trying tricks at all, which is the opposite of the point. */\n  flowPerPoint: 0.0042,\n  /* A gate is worth little meter because it costs little: every gate spans\n     the whole piste, so the ladder is really a count of how long the run\n     has stayed on it. At 0.035 a clean descent with no tricks at all was\n     filling the bar by itself. */\n  flowGate: 0.012,\n  flowButter: 0.05,\n  /* What riding alone is worth, and how the rest of the bar is held.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2e2771ca-b0f4-419d-92cc-5cc92760f30a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/fun/alpen","sessionId":"f31fbc8b-fac8-4283-8f36-bb5424b19347","version":"2.1.281","gitBranch":"main","slug":"enchanted-prancing-stroustrup"}
